==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[SSS Monkey King (Enemy)|SSS Monkey King]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

